    {
      "id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52/table-azure-1",
      "kind": "table",
      "missing": false,
      "description_sentences": 1,
      "use_for_sentences": 1,
      "ungrounded_numbers": [],
      "uncertain": "Body and insert carry a symbol footnote ('Body and insert available in LCB and other alloys') printed under the table, which Azure rendered as '®'. The item numbers are the callouts of the exploded view flowserve-worcester-f51-f52/fig-4.1."
    },
    {
      "id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52/table-azure-2",
      "kind": "table",
      "missing": false,
      "description_sentences": 1,
      "use_for_sentences": 1,
      "ungrounded_numbers": [],
      "uncertain": "Azure titled the table with the running page header; the size range comes from the subheading above the exploded view flowserve-worcester-f51-f52/fig-5.1, whose callouts are the item numbers. Body/insert footnote marker rendered as '®'."
    },
    {
      "id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52/table-azure-3",
      "kind": "table",
      "missing": false,
      "description_sentences": 1,
      "use_for_sentences": 1,
      "ungrounded_numbers": [],
      "uncertain": "C, D and F give two values each (maximum and minimum tolerance, footnote 1). Azure garbled some cells: NPS '34' (3/4) and '11/2 4' (1 1/2), a stray 'G' before the DN20 F51 weight and a stray '7' after a C value. The letters refer to the drawing flowserve-worcester-f51-f52/fig-8.1."
    },
    {
      "id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52/table-azure-4",
      "kind": "table",
      "missing": false,
      "description_sentences": 1,
      "use_for_sentences": 1,
      "ungrounded_numbers": [],
      "uncertain": "Many cells carry stray drawing labels from Azure ('F52 5', 'F07 B B', 'H 16.8', '1 F07', NPS '3 4'); J and K are '-' for DN150 and DN200 (gearbox as standard, footnote 3). The letters refer to the drawing flowserve-worcester-f51-f52/fig-9.1."
    },
    {
      "id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52/table-azure-5",
      "kind": "table",
      "missing": false,
      "description_sentences": 1,
      "use_for_sentences": 1,
      "ungrounded_numbers": [],
      "uncertain": "Azure merged several printed lines of the valve specification cell into one ('FM Approval Certified BS EN ISO 17292 ...', 'CRN TR CU 010/012/032'); 'Catgory III' is a misspelling in the source."
    },
    {
      "id": "flowserve-worcester-f51-f52/table-azure-6",
      "kind": "table",
      "missing": false,
      "description_sentences": 1,
      "use_for_sentences": 1,
